  "description": "      **********E-MAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY************\n\nHerbert & Lansdowne are delighted to present this bright and well-presented garden studio to the rental market.\n\nThe studio overlooks a beautiful landscaped garden and the accommodation comprises a fully fitted kitchen, a main bathroom, and a versatile living/sleeping area with a Murphy bed, which can be neatly folded away to maximise the available space during the day.  The property also benefits from electric heating and on street parking.\n\nWith its garden outlook, self-contained layout and clever use of space, this studio would make an ideal home for someone looking for comfortable and convenient accommodation.\n\nElectricity, heating and bins are included in the price.\n\nArkendale Road is a quiet residential cul-de-sac, a three-minute walk from Glenageary DART station and within walking distance of Dalkey & Sandycove.\n\n",
